# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

-> **API vs UI:** Terraform follows the Shift-Left API. `unavailable_conditions`: `AVOID_SCAN`, `DELETE_REPO`.

-> **Omitted settings inherit live values:** No integrate path — unset config attrs re-send live values on first apply, not create defaults. Set attrs explicitly to change them; import writes nothing.

-> **No installation resource:** The Orca GitHub App installation is the account unit (no `*_installation` resource). `account_id` is this unit's Orca UUID.

-> **Destroy:** `terraform destroy` DELETEs the integration; reinstall the Orca GitHub App to recover.

!> **Adopt semantics:** Adopts a pre-existing account; `destroy` de-integrates and drops repos. Refuses adopt when repos exist unless `adopt_existing = true`; prefer `terraform import` to avoid a takeover write.

-> **Coverage:** App install URL, GHES, browse repos, `check_availability`, and scan-now are not managed here.

